# Public-only tenant (no admin, no MOSC redesign)

This repo is a **public-only** tenant app. Copy this rule to sibling public-only projects (e.g. other cultural-org frontends) before stripping admin.

## **This tenant is public-only**

- No `/admin` routes, no Header Admin menu, no `src/app/admin`
- No `src/app/mosc-redesign`, no `src/app/mosc`, no `src/app/mosc-old`
- No `/school` CMS microsite (`src/app/school`) — this is the shared-template school site, **not** MOSC church `/schools`
- Do not add those trees back

## **Keep**

- Public Header and Footer (product chrome, not church leftovers)
- Clerk sign-in / sign-up
- `/api/proxy/*` (backend gateway — not admin UI)
- Webhooks (Stripe, etc.)
- Public product pages: events, gallery, membership, polls, focus-groups, sponsors, checkout
- [`MoscGalleryAlbumCard`](mdc:src/components/gallery/MoscGalleryAlbumCard.tsx) when the public gallery uses it (the `mosc-redesign` variant **name** on that card is allowed)

## **Before deleting admin**

Grep public/runtime code for admin imports and **move helpers first**:

```
rg "from '@/app/admin" src --glob "!src/app/admin/**"
```

Move only functions public pages still call into `src/lib/...` or the public feature folder (`src/app/polls/`, `src/app/focus-groups/`, `src/lib/payments/`).

```typescript
// ✅ DO: public poll page imports public actions
import { fetchEventPollServer } from '@/app/polls/ApiServerActions';

// ❌ DON'T: public page imports the deleted admin tree
import { fetchEventPollServer } from '@/app/admin/polls/ApiServerActions';
```

Never leave public code importing `@/app/admin` after the cut.

## **If `/school` exists in the target repo, delete it**

The shared Next template added `TenantSiteType = 'SCHOOL'` and a CMS microsite (`about/staff/departments/facilities/activities/admissions` + Razorpay fee pay). It is leftover on cultural public-only tenants. **Only delete paths that exist** — skip missing files.

This is **not** church Sunday School. Leave MOSC `/mosc/.../schools`, Sunday School HTML, `browserTabTitle` `schools:`, `schoolName` DTO fields, and `documentation/` / `public/images`.

```
rg "from '@/components/school|from '@/lib/school|SchoolHome|siteType === 'SCHOOL'|/api/school" src
```

Delete if present:

- `src/app/school/`
- `src/components/school/`
- `src/lib/school/`
- `src/app/api/school/`
- `src/lib/payments/razorpayFee.ts` — only if nothing except school fee-checkout / Razorpay webhook imports it
- `src/app/api/webhooks/razorpay/` — only if it only patches `school-fee-payments` / `school-fee-invoices` (keep Stripe / Clerk / Givebutter)

Then unwire:

- Middleware: `'/school(.*)'` and `'/api/school(.*)'`
- Homepage: `SchoolHome` import and `siteType === 'SCHOOL'` early return — `/` always renders the cultural homepage
- `TenantSiteType` `'SCHOOL'`, `TENANT_SITE_TYPE_LABELS.SCHOOL`, `siteTypePresets` `case 'SCHOOL'`
- Admin org form `<option value="SCHOOL">` if that select exists
- Smoke skip `'/school'` in TestSprite harness if present

Do not restore `/school` after the cut.

## **'use server' files**

Do **not** re-export types from `'use server'` modules. This repo returned HTTP 500 on `/focus-groups/[slug]` because Next treated `export type { EventFocusGroupDTO }` as a server action.

```typescript
// ✅ DO: local non-exported types inside the server-actions file
type FocusGroupAssociation = { id?: number; eventId?: number };

// ❌ DON'T
export type { EventFocusGroupDTO };
```

## **Header / layout**

```tsx
// ✅ DO: Header with nav + avatar / sign-in only
<Header hideMenuItems={false} />

// ❌ DON'T: Admin menu or tenant-admin prop
<Header isTenantAdmin={isTenantAdmin} />
```

- Do not render an Admin dropdown or `ADMIN_MENU`
- Do not run layout `isTenantAdmin` profile lookup (that clerk_auth “admin check on every page” rule does **not** apply on public-only tenants)
- Do not call `/api/auth/admin-status` from the Header

## **Tests**

- Public inventory smoke only
- No `TestSprite/admin-tests`
- Route inventory must not classify `mosc-redesign` / `mosc` / `mosc-old` / `school`
- No `test:admin*` or `test:mosc*` npm scripts

## **Leave unless the user asks**

- `documentation/` (including MOSC/church leftover docs)
- `public/images`

## **DO NOT**

- Restore `/admin` pages, admin CRUD, WhatsApp admin, tenant-management UI, `EventForm`
- Add `/mosc-redesign` routes or TestSprite kinds
- Restore `/school` CMS routes, `SchoolHome`, Razorpay school-fee checkout, or `TenantSiteType` `'SCHOOL'`
- Delete `public/images` or `documentation/` as part of this cut
